  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an organizational effectiveness grant to Build Up Inc., the fiscal sponsor for Next Narrative Africa (NNA), for NNA to focus on strategic planning as it builds a first of its kind hybrid model of a nonprofit venture studio and an equity fund. This OE grant will also allow NNA to partner with Parrot Analytics on a research partnership that will strengthen communications and marketing to attract more institutional investors.</narrative>
